              {
                "type": "codeBlock",
                "lang": "rust",
                "code": "// The first byte is 104 - the byte value of `'h'`\nlet s = \"hello\";\nassert_eq!(s.as_bytes()[0], 104);\n// or\nassert_eq!(s.as_bytes()[0], b'h');\n\n// The first byte is 240 which isn't obviously useful\nlet s = \"💖💖💖💖💖\";\nassert_eq!(s.as_bytes()[0], 240);"
