                    "text": "&str",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3Astr"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". The second way is more idiomatic, however both work to do the",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
