              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "String",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "s have an internal buffer to hold their data. The capacity is",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "the length of that buffer, and can be queried with the ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "capacity",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/string/struct.String.html#method.capacity"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "method. This method creates an empty ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "String",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", but one with an initial",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "buffer that can hold at least ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "capacity",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " bytes. This is useful when you",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "may be appending a bunch of data to the ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "String",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", reducing the number of",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "reallocations it needs to do.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "If the given capacity is ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "0",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", no allocation will occur, and this method",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "is identical to the ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "new",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/string/struct.String.html#method.new"
