      {
        "path": "link_resolution_tests::nested::Str::from_utf8",
        "kind": "function",
        "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/string/struct.String.html#method.from_utf8",
        "docs": [
          {
            "type": "truncatedBlock",
            "nodes": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Converts a vector of bytes to a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "String",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ".",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "A string (",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "String",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/string/struct.String.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ") is made of bytes (",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "u8",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3Au8"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "), and a vector of bytes",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "(",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Vec<u8>",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/vec/struct.Vec.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ") is made of bytes, so this function converts between the",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "two. Not all byte slices are valid ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "String",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "s, however: ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "String",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "requires that it is valid UTF-8. ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "from_utf8()",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " checks to ensure that",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "the bytes are valid UTF-8, and then does the conversion.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "If you are sure that the byte slice is valid UTF-8, and you don't want",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "to incur the overhead of the validity check, there is an unsafe version",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "of this function, ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "from_utf8_unchecked",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/string/struct.String.html#method.from_utf8_unchecked"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", which has the same behavior",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "but skips the check.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "This method will take care to not copy the vector, for efficiency's",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "sake.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "If you need a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "&str",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3Astr"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " instead of a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "String",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", consider",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "str::from_utf8",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/str/converts/index.html?search=core%3A%3Astr%3A%3Aconverts%3A%3Afrom%5Futf8"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ".",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "The inverse of this method is ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "into_bytes",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/string/struct.String.html#method.into_bytes"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ".",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Title",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Errors",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Returns ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Err",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/index.html?search=alloc%3A%3AErr"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " if the slice is not UTF-8 with a description as to why the",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "provided bytes are not UTF-8. The vector you moved in is also included.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "heading",
                "level": "Title",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Examples",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Basic usage:",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "codeBlock",
                "lang": "rust",
                "code": "// some bytes, in a vector\nlet sparkle_heart = vec![240, 159, 146, 150];\n\n// We know these bytes are valid, so we'll use `unwrap()`.\nlet sparkle_heart = String::from_utf8(sparkle_heart).unwrap();\n\nassert_eq!(\"💖\", sparkle_heart);"
              },
