                "code": "// some invalid bytes, in a vector\nlet sparkle_heart = vec![0, 159, 146, 150];\n\nassert!(String::from_utf8(sparkle_heart).is_err());"
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "See the docs for ",
