      },
      {
        "path": "link_resolution_tests::nested::Str::from_utf8_lossy",
        "kind": "function",
        "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/string/struct.String.html#method.from_utf8_lossy",
        "docs": [
          {
            "type": "truncatedBlock",
            "nodes": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Converts a slice of bytes to a string, including invalid characters.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "Strings are made of bytes (",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "u8",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3Au8"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "), and a slice of bytes",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "(",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "&[u8]",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/index.html?search=core%3A%3Aslice"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ") is made of bytes, so this function converts",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "between the two. Not all byte slices are valid strings, however: strings",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "are required to be valid UTF-8. During this conversion,",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "from_utf8_lossy()",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " will replace any invalid UTF-8 sequences with",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "U+FFFD REPLACEMENT CHARACTER",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/core/char/index.html?search=core%3A%3Achar%3A%3AREPLACEMENT%5FCHARACTER"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", which looks like this: �",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "If you are sure that the byte slice is valid UTF-8, and you don't want",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "to incur the overhead of the conversion, there is an unsafe version",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "of this function, ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "from_utf8_unchecked",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/string/struct.String.html#method.from_utf8_unchecked"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", which has the same behavior",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "but skips the checks.",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "spans": [
                  {
                    "text": "This function returns a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Cow<'a, str>",
                    "style": "InlineCode",
                    "url": "http://docs.rust-lang.org/nightly/alloc/borrow/enum.Cow.html"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". If our byte slice is invalid",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "UTF-8, then we need to insert the replacement characters, which will",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "change the size of the string, and hence, require a ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "String",
                    "style": "InlineCode"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". But if",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "it's already valid UTF-8, we don't need a new allocation. This return",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
