                "type": "codeBlock",
                "lang": "rust",
                "code": "use std::collections::BTreeMap;\n\nlet mut map = BTreeMap::new();\nmap.insert(3, \"c\");\nmap.insert(2, \"b\");\nmap.insert(1, \"a\");\n\nfor (key, value) in map.iter() {\n    println!(\"{key}: {value}\");\n}\n\nlet (first_key, first_value) = map.iter().next().unwrap();\nassert_eq!((*first_key, *first_value), (1, \"a\"));"
