                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "the allocated capacity of the data (in elements), and the allocator. These are the same",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " ",
                    "style": "Plain"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "arguments in the same order as the arguments to ",
